<title>NETHERLANDS: Robeco, Rolinco set 1996 divs.</title>
<headline>Robeco, Rolinco set 1996 divs.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch-based mutual fund Robeco said on Thursday it had set an unchanged cash dividend of 3.52 guilders per share for 1996.</p>
<p>Daughter equity fund Rolinco announced a 1996 cash dividend of 1.84 guilders against 1.96 in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
